An updated version of the curses windowport is available, which fixes
drawing issues with certain characters (specifically the "T" connector
characters which are often seen in the Gnomish Mines and some special
levels).  In addition, a patch to add this interface to Slash`EM
0.0.7E7F3 is now available.

I have not yet made an updated Windows binary for NetHack, nor have I
yet created a Slash`EM Windows binary.  I will do so if requested, or
when I get around to it, whichever comes first.

I have created a wiki homepage for the project, and all future updates
will be posted there rather than in this group:

http://nethack-curses.wikia.com/wiki/NetHack_Curses_Interface_Wiki

